Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.98,0:03:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第3季第3集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.62,0:00:11.71,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.04,0:01:13.42,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.70,0:11:29.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（康涅狄格州）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.75,0:14:20.71,Note,0,0,0,0,,（比格森餐厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.53,0:25:14.11,Note,0,0,0,0,,（汽车旅馆）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.22,0:26:21.72,Note,0,0,0,0,,（纽约市 皇后区）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.46,0:27:30.58,Note,0,0,0,0,,（错误）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.63,0:27:32.71,Note,0,0,0,0,,（回头）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.12,0:00:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, dad's gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.20,0:00:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得继承他的遗志\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to carry out his legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.95,0:00:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that means hunting down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.95,0:00:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,能猎杀多少凶鬼恶灵杀多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}as many evil sons of bitches as we possibly can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.71,0:00:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I die?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.54,0:00:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为我出卖了灵魂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you sell your soul for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.08,0:00:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.38,0:00:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}One year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.29,0:00:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该那么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't have done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.59,0:00:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来要换我救你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I gotta save your ass for a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.97,0:00:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的刀能杀恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of blade can kill a demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.01,0:00:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天的话 我会说没有这种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday, I'd have said there was no such thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.18,0:00:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那无名小妞是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was that masked chick?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.64,0:00:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你遇见过一个叫戈登·沃克的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever run across a guy named Gordon Walker?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.64,0:00:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对他身边的所有人和事物都是个威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is dangerous to everyone and everything around him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.19,0:00:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个恶魔告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}This demon tells me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.23,0:00:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有士兵会在这场将到来的战争里作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}they have soldiers to fight in this coming war.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.94,0:00:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类 为地狱而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humans fighting on hell's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.86,0:00:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.69,0:00:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于萨姆能看到幻象\N{\fnArial\fs30}about Sam's visions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.94,0:00:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.82,0:00:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弟弟是我的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your brother's fair game.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.29,0:00:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登接下来几年里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gordon should be reaching for the soap.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.63,0:00:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定要捡肥皂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the next few years at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.96,0:00:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me who you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.01,0:01:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来找你是因为我想帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here because I wanna help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.05,0:01:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能给我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What could you possibly…?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.39,0:01:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能帮你救你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could help you save your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.11,0:01:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,胳膊抬起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lift your arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.94,0:01:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.79,0:01:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.17,0:01:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,怀俄明州的一个魔鬼之门被打开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Devil's Gate was opened in Wyoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.30,0:01:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,很大的门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有圣赫勒拿那么大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saint Helena's big.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.31,0:01:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法确切知道有多少恶魔逃出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no solid fix on how many demons got out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.02,0:01:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有上百个 一支大军\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's in the hundreds. An army.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.98,0:01:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆·温彻斯特当时在场 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Winchester was there, wasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.81,0:02:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟一个认识鲍比·辛格一个朋友的人谈过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talked to a guy who knows a guy who knows Bobby Singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.74,0:02:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.24,0:02:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来大门被打开时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like the Winchesters were at ground zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.24,0:02:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,温家兄弟就在当场\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the gate was popped.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.28,0:02:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但辛格说 他们是去阻止开门的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Singer said they went in there to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.83,0:02:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比不像以前那么敏锐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby's edge ain't what it used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.70,0:02:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆现在能骗他相信任何鬼话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam could have him believing anything by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.79,0:02:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 戈登 据传言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Gordon, as far as talk goes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.33,0:02:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆·温彻斯特没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Winchester checks out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.88,0:02:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是个猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a hunter, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.25,0:02:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.80,0:02:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,库布里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kubrick…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.51,0:02:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不确定他是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not even sure he's human.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.89,0:02:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think I'm crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.77,0:02:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我六个月前就告诉你战争要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you there was a war coming six months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.10,0:02:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你身边吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.98,0:02:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争是来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.86,0:02:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我跟你说这小子是这场战争的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm telling you this boy is a part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.74,0:02:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他 库布里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Track him down, Kubrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.07,0:02:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也会明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll come to see it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.24,0:02:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆·温彻斯特必须死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Winchester must die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.13,0:03:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because demon, that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.67,0:03:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一发现这个露比是个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the second you find out this Ruby chick is a demon…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.84,0:03:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,就该去拿圣水 不是跟她闲聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}you go for the holy water. You don't chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.97,0:03:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没闲聊 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one was chatting, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.39,0:03:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 那你怎么没把她送回地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Then why didn't you send her ass back to hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.22,0:03:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 她说她或许能帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because… Because she said she might be able to help us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.98,0:03:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么帮\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.65,0:03:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 说真的 萨姆 她怎么可能帮得上我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, really, Sam, how? How could she possibly help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.86,0:03:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说她能帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She told me she could help you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.48,0:03:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮你摆脱十字路口交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help you out of the Crossroads deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.24,0:03:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么毛病 她在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is wrong with you, huh? She's lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.91,0:03:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta know that, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.49,0:03:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她知道你的弱点是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She knows what your weakness is. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.04,0:03:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else did she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.08,0:03:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.88,0:03:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.34,0:03:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有了 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.30,0:03:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我又不傻 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm not an idiot, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.38,0:03:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说要信任她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not talking about trusting her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.13,0:03:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说要利用她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about using her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.09,0:03:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在打仗 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we're at war, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.80,0:03:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对敌人完全不了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we don't know jack about the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.35,0:03:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道他们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know where they are,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.10,0:03:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道他们在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}we don't know what they're doing,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.47,0:03:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都不知道他们想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, hell we don't even know what they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.14,0:04:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this Ruby girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.39,0:04:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道的信息 我们自己绝对查不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}knows more than we will ever find out on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.15,0:04:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 这是冒险 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, yes, it's a risk, I know that,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.57,0:04:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们必须冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we need to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.03,0:04:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧 你感觉还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're okay, right? I mean, you feeling okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.44,0:04:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.40,0:04:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干吗老问我这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you always asking me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.87,0:04:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.04,0:04:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.00,0:04:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看储物箱 是爸爸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the glove compartment. It's Dad's.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.71,0:04:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸的 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad's? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.58,0:04:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保持手机充满电 以防他的老熟人来电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep it charged up in case any of his old contacts call.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.17,0:04:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.76,0:04:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我是埃德加·凯西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, this is Edgar Cayce.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.60,0:04:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 别报警 我自己处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Don't call the police. I'll handle this myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.60,0:04:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 你可以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. You know, can you just,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.52,0:04:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以重新帮我锁好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}can you just lock it back up for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.06,0:04:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.86,0:04:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我的记事簿不在手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I don't have my book in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.86,0:04:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以把地址给我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you…? Do you have the address so I…?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.57,0:04:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好 说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. Okay. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.24,0:04:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 多谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.54,0:05:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸跟你说过他在一间仓库里有个集装箱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad ever tell you he kept a container at a storage place?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.87,0:05:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 在水牛城城外\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Outside of Buffalo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.25,0:05:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不会吧 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No way. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.79,0:05:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人刚刚闯了进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And someone just broke into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.39,0:05:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你并没有这个温彻斯特的什么实证\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you got no hard evidence on this Winchester guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.90,0:05:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是听信了戈登的直觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just working off Gordon's instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.40,0:05:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟戈登一起猎过魔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever hunt with Gordon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.78,0:05:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.61,0:05:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说他很厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard he's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.94,0:05:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.07,0:05:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是最厉害的 救过我好多次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the best. Saved my ass more times than I can count.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.20,0:05:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他说萨姆·温彻斯特是危险人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if he says Sam Winchester is dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.33,0:05:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就相信他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.20,0:05:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定会掩盖踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna be covering his tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.91,0:05:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会好找的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't be easy to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.37,0:05:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我能查到的 他三周前去过内布拉斯加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last I got, puts him in Nebraska three weeks back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.58,0:05:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这线索不新了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly a fresh lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.96,0:05:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他又不是隐形人 克雷迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ain't invisible, Creedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.67,0:05:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有猎人知道点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some hunter out there knows something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.97,0:05:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们挨个联系我们认识的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we start calling our contacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.09,0:05:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只需要走一回运\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we need is one break.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.61,0:06:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我的耶稣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't play with my Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.58,0:06:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.95,0:06:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.50,0:06:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.41,0:06:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和他的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, him and his secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.21,0:06:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他在一起那么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spend all this time with the guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.50,0:06:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们还是不怎么了解他\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's like we barely even know the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.92,0:06:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们马上要了解到点什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're about to learn something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.19,0:06:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔止步\N{\fnArial\fs30}No demons allowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.90,0:06:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.74,0:06:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.41,0:07:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,闯进来的人被打中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever broke in here got tagged.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.67,0:07:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear old Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.54,0:07:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到两组靴印\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got two sets of boot treads here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.13,0:07:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来是两人作案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like it was a two-man job.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.67,0:07:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,被打中的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And our friend with the buckshot in him,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.34,0:07:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来没被打死\N{\fnArial\fs30}looks like he kept walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.47,0:07:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事 爸爸会在这里工作吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's the deal? Dad would do work here or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.10,0:07:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是生活得那么奢侈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Living the high life, as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.29,0:07:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 1995年的 - 不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 1995. - No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.58,0:07:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的区足球锦标赛奖杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my division championship soccer trophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.79,0:07:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信他留下了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe he kept this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.71,0:07:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.46,0:07:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可能是你最像个小男孩的时刻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably the closest you ever came to being a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.64,0:08:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的第一把锯断猎枪 我自己做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my first sawed-off. I made it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.73,0:08:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,六年级\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sixth grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.24,0:08:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.42,0:08:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个 他还有地雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this, he had land mines.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.59,0:08:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which they didn't take.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.88,0:08:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没拿枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.76,0:08:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来他们很清楚自己想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess they knew what they were after, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.43,0:08:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.89,0:08:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到这些符号了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}See these symbols?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.89,0:08:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是束缚咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's binding magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.27,0:08:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是诅咒盒\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are curse boxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.02,0:08:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,诅咒盒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curse boxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.07,0:08:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是用来把邪恶魔法困在里面的 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supposed to keep the evil mojo in, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.90,0:09:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就像潘多拉魔盒 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kinda like the Pandora deal. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.07,0:09:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 是建造来容纳诅咒物件魔力的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. They're built to contain the power of the cursed object.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.91,0:09:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸的日记里是提到过好多东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's journal did mention a whole bunch of stuff, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.32,0:09:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,危险的被施咒的物品 魔物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dangerous hexed items, fetishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.20,0:09:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可他没说过那些东西都哪去了 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He never did say where they ended up. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.24,0:09:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来这里是他的有毒垃圾场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this must be his toxic-waste dump.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.67,0:09:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个盒子不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One box is missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.13,0:09:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.05,0:09:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许他们没打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe they didn't open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.43,0:09:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 伙计 我们把它打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. Let's open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.72,0:09:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,别逼逼那破盒子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up about the damn box!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.10,0:09:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到现在的情况了没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see what's happening here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.68,0:09:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都要流血致死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm literally bleeding to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.73,0:09:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要打开它 - 格罗斯曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna open it. - Grossman.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.52,0:09:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这玩意真挺值钱呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, what if this is really worth something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.56,0:09:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 我们就该把这交给她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, we should just hand it over to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.32,0:09:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,冒险是我们冒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We took all the risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.90,0:09:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦恩 你还中枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, Wayne, you got shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.66,0:09:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就为了几百块\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all for a lousy few hundred bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.12,0:09:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们自己卖掉里面的东西 能挣更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we could make more selling whatever it is ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.64,0:10:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑 开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me? Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.19,0:10:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是只兔脚 是只兔脚 格罗斯曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a rabbit's foot. It's a rabbit's foot, Grossman!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.28,0:10:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要为只破兔脚而死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna die for a damn rabbit's foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.03,0:10:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 又怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.66,0:10:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,福斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Foster.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.00,0:10:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 伙计们 不是我找事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, guys, not to be a drag or nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.71,0:10:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但这才大早上6点 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- but it's 6:00 in the morning. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.30,0:10:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们不能小点声吗 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can't you keep it down? - No, we…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.42,0:10:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是有点情况 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}just got a situation here is all. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.01,0:10:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.43,0:10:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,被猎枪打了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shotgun happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.27,0:10:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 格罗斯曼 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Grossman. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.22,0:10:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我水池下面有个医疗包\N{\fnArial\fs30}Under my sink, there's a medical kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.27,0:10:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,再去烧点水\N{\fnArial\fs30}And get some water boiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.19,0:10:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.98,0:11:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在越南做过医护兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to be an Army medic, you know, in Nam.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.03,0:11:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你今天走运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I guess this is your lucky day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.34,0:11:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,康涅狄格州 最后三位是880\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connecticut. Last three digits: 880.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.60,0:11:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 就是它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.64,0:11:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不该不涂黑车牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should've blacked out their plates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.73,0:11:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,就停在监控范围内\N{\fnArial\fs30}before they parked in front of the security camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.81,0:11:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,四个K\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.57,0:11:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看到了吗 - 难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You see that? - Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.94,0:11:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.11,0:11:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,再发一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal it up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.03,0:11:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,红桃K\N{\fnArial\fs30}King of hearts?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.37,0:11:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,红桃A\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ace of hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.37,0:11:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,同花大顺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Royal flush.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.50,0:12:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,格罗斯曼 这是八手里第二个同花大顺了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grossman, that's the second royal flush in eight hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.79,0:12:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 这真好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, this is a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.13,0:12:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我输不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.05,0:12:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的输不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, really, I… I can't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.80,0:12:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许这玩意真好使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe this thing really works.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.05,0:12:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.85,0:12:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你 我们绝不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you one thing, there's no way in hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.85,0:12:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它交给那个自命不凡的贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're handing it over to that stuck-up bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.43,0:12:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我们受了多少罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not after all we've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.02,0:12:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.77,0:12:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧 我们去玩玩吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out of here. Let's go have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.11,0:12:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 都别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze! Freeze! Nobody move!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.82,0:12:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.44,0:12:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.36,0:12:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干什么 - 别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is this? - Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.36,0:12:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 把盒子给我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, give us the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.78,0:12:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托告诉我你们没…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And please tell me that you didn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.61,0:12:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们打开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.62,0:12:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们打开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You opened it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.79,0:12:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是警察吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you guys cops, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.08,0:12:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们是警察吗 - 盒子里是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you guys cops? - What was in the box?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.47,0:12:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.54,0:12:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.21,0:12:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.43,0:13:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.92,0:13:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.76,0:13:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.59,0:13:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.14,0:13:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.28,0:13:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.75,0:14:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a lucky break.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.09,0:14:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是兔脚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That a rabbit's foot?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.05,0:14:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.07,0:14:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在爸爸的日记里什么都没找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not finding anything on it in Dad's journal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.66,0:14:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 拜托 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean, come on. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.16,0:14:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可是拿我的枪对着你的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was my gun he was aiming at your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.70,0:14:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的枪不会卡 所以那是好运气\N{\fnArial\fs30}My gun don't jam, so that was a lucky break.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.04,0:14:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,更别提 他们还自己撞晕了 也是好运气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to mention them taking themselves out, also a lucky break.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.83,0:14:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 刮开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Scratch one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.34,0:14:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 萨姆 刮开赢奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sam. Scratch and win.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.13,0:14:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 这上面肯定有诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, it's gotta be cursed somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.05,0:15:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则爸爸也不会把它锁起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise Dad wouldn't have locked it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.35,0:15:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,1200美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twelve hundred dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.27,0:15:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚赢了1200美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just won $1200.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.07,0:15:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我不觉得它像诅咒呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, man. Doesn't seem that cursed to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.29,0:15:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,格罗斯曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grossman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.80,0:15:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,格罗斯曼 起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grossman, get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.43,0:15:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,格罗斯曼 起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grossman, get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.60,0:16:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,格罗斯曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grossman?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.81,0:16:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,格罗斯曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grossman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.16,0:16:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.37,0:16:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 我们又不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, look, Bobby, we didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.87,0:16:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你碰它了 该死 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You touched it? Damn it, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.71,0:16:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸没跟我们提过这玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Dad never told us about this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.88,0:16:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他在黑岩有个仓库吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you knew about his storage place in Black Rock?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.96,0:16:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的仓库吗 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}His lockup? Yeah, I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.51,0:17:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些诅咒盒还是我给他做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I built those curse boxes for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.01,0:17:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你的麻烦大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you have got a serious problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.05,0:17:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只兔脚可不是骗人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That rabbit's foot ain't no dime-store notion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.77,0:17:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是真巫术\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's real Hoodoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.10,0:17:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很古老的 - 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Old World stuff. - Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.77,0:17:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个巴吞鲁日巫女大概一百年前做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made by a Baton Rouge conjure woman about a hundred years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.15,0:17:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好厉害的幸运符啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a hell of a luck charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.73,0:17:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是幸运符 是诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a luck charm. It's a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.65,0:17:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是做来杀人的 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}She made it to kill people, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.61,0:17:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你碰到它 它就属于你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, you touch it, you own it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.99,0:17:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,它属于你时 是啊 你会好运连连\N{\fnArial\fs30}You own it, sure, you get a run of good luck to beat the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.95,0:17:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但等你丢了它 运气就逆转了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you lose it, that luck turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.37,0:17:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,急转直下 你一周内就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}It turns so bad that you're dead inside a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.21,0:17:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就不弄丢它 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, so I won't lose it, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.71,0:17:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人最终都会弄丢它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody loses it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.13,0:17:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们怎么打破诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then how do we break the curse?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.92,0:17:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你能不能打破\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.67,0:17:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来翻翻我的藏书 再找人问问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me look through my library and make some calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.30,0:17:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我消息吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just sit tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.56,0:17:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.14,0:17:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们赢到1.5万了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're up 15 grand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.19,0:18:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 鲍比会找到办法打破诅咒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. Bobby will find a way to break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.53,0:18:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,在此之前 我们去维加斯吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until then, I say we hit Vegas,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.99,0:18:06.20,Title,0,0,0,0,,演一出《雨人》 你来演雨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}pull a little Rain Man. You can be Rain Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.20,0:18:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就按兵不动 等待鲍比再来电 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we lay low until Bobby calls back, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.45,0:18:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,两人桌 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Table for two, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.58,0:18:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.00,0:18:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 好让人激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exciting, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.21,0:18:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是比格森餐厅大家庭的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the one millionth guest…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.92,0:18:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一百万位客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the Biggerson's Restaurant family!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.92,0:18:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.71,0:18:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 你听到什么消息就联系我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. You hear anything, you give me a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.47,0:18:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的联络人都打过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that clears my book.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.35,0:18:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,消息传开了 现在我们等着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The word's out. Now we wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.44,0:18:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们吃东西吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.10,0:18:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.69,0:18:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想吃什么 我有各种罐头\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you like? I got canned everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.27,0:18:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 伙计 别在房车里吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, man. Not eating in the RV.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.90,0:18:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道个好地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know a good place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.03,0:18:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,菜单花样多 服务好 气氛温馨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wide menu, good service, homey atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.36,0:18:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有大蒜结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garlic knots.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.74,0:18:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们网站上有菜单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Menu's on their website.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.00,0:18:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比是对的 这传说历史悠久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby's right. This lore goes way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.54,0:18:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,纯巫术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pure Hoodoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.46,0:19:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能随便找只兔子切腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just cut one off any rabbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.62,0:19:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须在一个公墓里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has to be in a cemetery,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.30,0:19:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一个13日星期五的满月下\N{\fnArial\fs30}under a full moon, on a Friday the 13th.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.22,0:19:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,从今往后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say from now on…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.64,0:19:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只去有比格森餐厅的城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}we only go to places with Biggerson's.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.06,0:19:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我给你续杯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I freshen you up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.69,0:19:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.44,0:19:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.66,0:19:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来擦擦吧 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me wipe up. - No worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.91,0:19:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要紧 我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay. That's… I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.04,0:19:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不麻烦的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no trouble, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.33,0:19:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.29,0:19:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.83,0:19:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.27,0:19:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.52,0:20:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你这辈子能走桃花运\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you were ever gonna get lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.31,0:20:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.24,0:20:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.74,0:20:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.62,0:20:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么能算好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was that good?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.96,0:20:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.27,0:20:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.69,0:20:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.53,0:20:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你的运气现在变坏了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, now your luck turns bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.83,0:20:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.04,0:21:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道会多坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wonder how bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.09,0:21:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.75,0:21:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢他们把整个洋葱丢进去炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like that, when they drop the whole onion in the fryer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.92,0:21:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近的一家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nearest location…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.01,0:21:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seeing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.48,0:21:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.87,0:21:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adiós, compadre.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.36,0:21:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.01,0:21:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还想怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.51,0:21:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说你朋友的事了 真倒霉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard about your friend. That's bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.68,0:21:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Piss off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.35,0:22:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道有人雇了你们偷兔脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know someone hired you to steal the rabbit's foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.23,0:22:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.23,0:22:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.11,0:22:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.32,0:22:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她刚从我们手里偷走了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because she just stole it back from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.61,0:22:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 伙计 这事很严…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, man, this is serio…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.45,0:22:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆 你没事吧 - 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam, are you okay? - Yeah, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.00,0:22:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我们她叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to tell us her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.96,0:22:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.80,0:22:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的伙伴不是死于意外事故\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't a freak accident that killed your partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.51,0:22:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.63,0:22:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那个兔脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the rabbit's foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.26,0:22:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're crazy, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.51,0:22:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你清楚我没疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.18,0:22:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到它都做到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw what happened, what it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.77,0:22:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,各种巧合 运气\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the flukes, all the luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.06,0:22:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你失去兔脚后 运气便变坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you lose the foot, that luck goes sour.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.65,0:22:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才是害死你朋友的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what killed your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.15,0:22:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我弟弟就是下一个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my brother here is next.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.32,0:22:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道之后还有多少无辜者会因此而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who knows how many more innocent people after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.53,0:22:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不帮我们阻止它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if you don't help us stop this thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.82,0:23:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些人的死便要算在你头上\N{\fnArial\fs30}that puts those deaths on your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.87,0:23:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会识人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I can read people.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.12,0:23:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.75,0:23:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个贼 人渣 这没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a thief and a scumbag. That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.75,0:23:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不是杀人犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not a killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.01,0:23:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.23,0:23:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人看到他们去了哪边\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one saw which way they went.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.81,0:23:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且因为免单 他们也没用信用卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And their meal was free so there's no credit-card trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.44,0:23:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我们会找到他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, we'll find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.28,0:23:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么那么确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you so sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.03,0:23:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这里面有更高力量在运作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because there's a higher power at work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.16,0:23:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.37,0:23:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.17,0:23:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, great news.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.96,0:23:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然不容易 但我找到个很厉害的净化咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't easy, but I found a heavyweight cleansing ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.09,0:23:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该会好用\N{\fnArial\fs30}that should do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.26,0:23:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 那太好了 但萨姆…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, that's, uh, great. Except Sam…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.51,0:24:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆丢了兔脚 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam lost the foot. - He what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.60,0:24:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, listen. Listen. This,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.60,0:24:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个辣妹从他身上偷走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}this hot chick stole it from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.73,0:24:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 她25左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm serious. She was in her mid 20s.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.23,0:24:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且很厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she was sharp, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.19,0:24:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉害到骗过了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good enough with the con to play us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.11,0:24:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只跟她雇的人说了个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she only gave the guy she hired a name,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.27,0:24:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能也是假名\N{\fnArial\fs30}probably an alias or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.53,0:24:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是路易吉什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luigi or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.74,0:24:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是卢戈西 - 卢戈西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lugosi. - Lugosi.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.70,0:24:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢戈西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lugosi?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.62,0:24:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢戈西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lugos…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.62,0:24:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 可能是贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap. It's probably Bela.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.62,0:24:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉·卢戈西（饰演吸血鬼德古拉的男演员）吗 还挺逗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bela Lugosi? That's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.16,0:24:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真名叫贝拉·塔伯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bela Talbot's her real name.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.17,0:24:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟她有过一两次交集\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crossed paths with her once or twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.46,0:24:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,她知道兔脚的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}She knew about the rabbit's foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.46,0:24:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是猎人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she a hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.13,0:24:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty frigging far from a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.71,0:24:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她很熟悉这个领域\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she knows her way around the territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.01,0:24:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她之前出国了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's been out of the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.05,0:24:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我之前所知 她去了中东什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last I heard she was in the Middle East some place.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.34,0:24:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来她回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess she's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.05,0:24:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说就很不幸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means seriously bad luck for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.77,0:24:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.93,0:24:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果真是贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if it is Bela…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.14,0:24:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我或许认识知道去哪能找到她的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}at least I might know some folks who know where to find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.94,0:24:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 鲍比 再次感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Bobby. Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.94,0:24:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,照顾好你的弟弟吧 白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just look out for your brother, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.24,0:25:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.57,0:25:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我丢了只鞋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost my shoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.30,0:25:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 鲍比 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Bobby, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.80,0:25:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们又欠你个人情\N{\fnArial\fs30}We owe you another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.55,0:25:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 鲍比打探到可靠消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Bobby's got it on pretty good authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.09,0:25:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个贝拉住在皇后区\N{\fnArial\fs30}that this Bela chick lives in Queens.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.97,0:25:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开车两小时就能过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it'll take me about two hours to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.35,0:25:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们来这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are we doing then?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.06,0:25:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 我的弟弟 要待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, my brother, are staying here…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.48,0:25:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不希望你的噩运害死我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I don't want your bad luck getting us killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.00,0:25:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该做什么啊 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I even supposed to do, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.54,0:25:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都不做 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. Nothing. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.83,0:25:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要你做任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want you doing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.25,0:25:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你坐在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to sit right here…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.80,0:25:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,一动别动 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and don't move, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.05,0:26:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别去开灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't turn on the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.92,0:26:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,别去关灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't turn off the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.34,0:26:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,连鼻子都别挠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't even scratch your nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.87,0:26:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们说好的是150\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you shook on 1.5.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.00,0:26:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那或许我该卖给别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe I should just take it somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.92,0:26:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,别威胁我 卢克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't threaten me, Luke.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.71,0:26:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管你名声在外 我并不怕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Despite your reputation, you don't scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.68,0:26:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你能这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm glad you see it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.64,0:26:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一小时后机场见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you at the airstrip in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.69,0:27:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没拿小费就走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left without your tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.38,0:28:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.92,0:28:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都没…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't… I wasn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.91,0:29:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.91,0:29:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我才不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetie. No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.33,0:29:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,走着瞧吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.58,0:29:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bela, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.00,0:29:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.63,0:29:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.75,0:29:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道那玩意有诅咒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the thing's cursed, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.55,0:29:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想不到有些人会愿意为这种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd be surprised what some people would pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.09,0:29:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,出多少钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}for something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.30,0:29:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.59,0:29:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这方面有个利润丰厚的市场呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lucrative market out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.22,0:29:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以挣大钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of money to be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.31,0:29:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些猎人 用各种护身符什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hunters with all those amulets and talismans you use.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.85,0:29:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止可怕的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}to stop those big, bad monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.15,0:29:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便哪个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.98,0:29:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,都足够让你们的孙辈上大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}could put your children's children through college.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.74,0:29:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you know the truth…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.15,0:29:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道外面有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}about what's really going on out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.57,0:29:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却做了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this is what you decide to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.49,0:29:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,做个贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You become a thief?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.83,0:30:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为特定客户获取一些独特的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I procure unique items for a select clientele.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.25,0:30:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.08,0:30:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.08,0:30:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.50,0:30:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是神偷\N{\fnArial\fs30}A great thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.89,0:30:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.56,0:30:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒过来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back with us, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.10,0:30:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都没碰你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't even have to touch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.56,0:30:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己抽抽搭搭地撞昏了过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just went all spastic and knocked yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.06,0:30:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直像看谐星杰瑞·刘易斯踩一堆摞起来的椅子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was like watching Jerry Lewis ride a stacked chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.90,0:30:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.28,0:30:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想要什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you wa…?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.70,0:30:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本以为是你朋友戈登派我来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to think your friend Gordon sent me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.24,0:30:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gordon?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.20,0:30:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.95,0:30:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他叫我找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he asked me to track you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.62,0:30:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后一枪崩了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and put a bullet in your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.17,0:30:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 听上去像他的做派\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. That sounds like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.04,0:30:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.59,0:30:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来\N{\fnArial\fs30}as it turns out…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.17,0:30:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在执行上帝的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on a mission from God.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.18,0:30:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 我弟弟 他碰了兔脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Bela, my brother, he touched the foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.18,0:31:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你夺走之后 他的好运就变成了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when you took it from him, his luck went from…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.47,0:31:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我清楚原理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.27,0:31:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你知道他会死的 除非我们销毁它\N{\fnArial\fs30}So then, you know he's gonna die unless we can destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.06,0:31:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,兔脚可以给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can have the foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.32,0:31:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要150万美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}For 1.5 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.86,0:31:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.32,0:31:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我联系下我的银行家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just call my banker.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.28,0:31:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么找到这玩意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you even find the damn thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.37,0:31:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,藏在那么隐蔽的仓库深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stuck in the back of some storage place, middle of nowhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.92,0:31:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问了几个被它害死的人的鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just asked a few of the ghosts of the people it had killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.21,0:31:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们能感应到它的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were very attuned into its location.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.55,0:31:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只在乎自己 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're only out for yourself, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.34,0:31:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,都为了你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all about number one?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.84,0:31:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,做猎人就高尚得多吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being a hunter is so much more noble?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.31,0:31:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群执迷于复仇的反社会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bunch of obsessed, revenge-driven sociopaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.68,0:31:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,努力拯救无法被拯救的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to save a world that can't be saved?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.10,0:31:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还真是乐观呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, aren't you a glass half full?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.06,0:31:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都要下地狱 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all going to hell, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.27,0:31:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如享受一番\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might as well enjoy the ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.90,0:31:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我倒是同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I actually agree with you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.03,0:31:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正 聊得愉快 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyhoo, this has been charming, but,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.86,0:31:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这都几点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}look at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.32,0:32:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.62,0:32:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你不是唯一手脚不干净的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you're not the only one with sticky fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.75,0:32:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能让你好受点 我觉得你真是个烂人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's any consolation, I think you're a truly awful person.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.81,0:32:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,回见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.99,0:32:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你参与了恶魔打开魔鬼之门的计划 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were part of that demon plan to open the gate, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.82,0:32:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们尽全力阻止了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did everything we could to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.24,0:32:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lie, lie, lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.58,0:32:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟他们是一伙儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were in on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.83,0:32:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还知道他们的下一步计划吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what their next move is, too, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.79,0:32:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不知道 你全搞错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't, okay? You're wrong about all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.71,0:32:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们接下来要袭击哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they gonna hit us next?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.46,0:32:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.09,0:33:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登跟我说了你 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gordon told me about you, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.68,0:33:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,说了你的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}About your powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.14,0:33:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个奇怪的灵力怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're some kind of weirdo, psychic freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.14,0:33:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 现在不是了 我没有能力 没有幻视了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not anymore. I have no powers, no visions.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.69,0:33:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么都没了 - 撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nothing. It's just… - Lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.27,0:33:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再撒谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, no more lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.86,0:33:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在外面有一支恶魔大军\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an army of demons out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.82,0:33:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,摧残着一个本就处于崩溃边缘的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}pushing at a world already on the brink.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.53,0:33:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们即将迎来终局 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on deck for the end game here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.08,0:33:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那或许\N{\fnArial\fs30}So maybe,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.91,0:33:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许 你能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}just maybe, you can understand…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.50,0:33:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为何不能冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}why we can't take chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.25,0:33:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 等一下的 - 库布里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. Okay, now, hold on a minute. - Kubrick…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.71,0:33:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你什么都看到了 克雷迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You saw what happened, Creedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.09,0:33:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己想想 我们为什么会在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask yourself, why are we here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.68,0:33:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你看到了网站上的一张照片吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you saw a picture on the web?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.89,0:33:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们选择了这家旅馆 而不是另一家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we chose this motel instead of another?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.76,0:33:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种运气不会凭空出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luck like that doesn't just happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.73,0:33:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这我都能解释 你… - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, I can explain all of that if… - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.65,0:33:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是上帝 克雷迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's God, Creedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.02,0:33:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他指引我们来这里只有一个原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}He led us here for one reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.52,0:33:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,行他的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}To do his work.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.82,0:34:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.74,0:34:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope. No destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.28,0:34:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是个兔脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a rabbit's foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.45,0:34:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下枪 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the gun down, son…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.79,0:34:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然等着擦墙上的脑浆吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you're gonna be scraping brain off the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.75,0:34:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.63,0:34:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 就那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.05,0:34:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.67,0:34:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 有件关于我的事你不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you see, there's something about me that you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.93,0:34:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what would that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.64,0:34:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my lucky day.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.95,0:34:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你看到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God. Did you see that shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.69,0:34:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太厉害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.61,0:34:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是蝙蝠侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.24,0:34:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.54,0:34:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是蝙蝠侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.05,0:34:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.09,0:35:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,骨灰 卡宴辣椒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bone ash. Cayenne pepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.30,0:35:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.34,0:35:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍等\N{\fnArial\fs30}One second.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.59,0:35:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.40,0:35:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,少来 霉鬼 看我行大运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off, jinx. Bringing home the bacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.23,0:35:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.77,0:35:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见吧 坏兔子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say goodbye, rascally rabbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.70,0:35:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你会发现那是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you'll find that belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.57,0:35:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者…随便了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or, you know, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.57,0:35:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,把兔脚放下 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the foot down, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.00,0:35:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.17,0:35:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会开枪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna shoot anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.23,0:35:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这人会识人\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I happen to be able to read people.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.47,0:35:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你是个贼 但你不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you're a thief, fine, but you're not…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.47,0:35:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 别过来 猛男\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Son of a… - Back off, tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.85,0:35:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.23,0:35:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再动一下 我就扣扳机\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make one more move and I'll pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.61,0:36:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有运气 迪恩 我打不中你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got the luck, Dean. You I can't hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.90,0:36:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}But your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.57,0:36:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打不偏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him I can't miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.36,0:36:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.28,0:36:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能随便这么冲人开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't just go around shooting people like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.24,0:36:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.41,0:36:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是打了肩 我会瞄准的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a shoulder hit. I can aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.16,0:36:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说 这里谁没冲人开过枪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, who here hasn't shot a few people?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.46,0:36:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上把兔脚放地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the rabbit's foot on the ground now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.09,0:36:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.63,0:36:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.96,0:36:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,反应快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.52,0:36:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.98,0:36:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.65,0:36:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把那破玩意销毁掉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}what do you say we destroy that ugly-ass piece of dead thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.03,0:36:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.08,0:36:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我丢了150万美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm out one-and-a-half million.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.46,0:37:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,还惹到了一个很有权势的疯子买家\N{\fnArial\fs30}and on the bad side of a powerful, fairly psychotic buyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.17,0:37:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一点不为此感到不安呢 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really don't feel bad about that. Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.01,0:37:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.42,0:37:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全不呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.89,0:37:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许下次 会是我对你不管不顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe next time, I'll hang you out to dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.23,0:37:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别气冲冲地离开 离开就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go away angry. Just go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.23,0:37:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你们晚上愉快 小伙子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a nice night, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.20,0:37:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.58,0:37:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,死不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll live.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.04,0:37:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们回归正常了 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we're back to normal now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.75,0:37:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有好运 没有厄运\N{\fnArial\fs30}No good luck, no bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.05,0:37:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,差点忘了 我们赢了4.6万美元了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgot, we're up $46, 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.63,0:37:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,差点忘了那些…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost forgot about the…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.51,0:37:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,刮刮乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}scratch tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.03,0:38:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.79,0:38:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你全都说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.46,0:38:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆·温彻斯特不是单纯的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Winchester is more than a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.79,0:38:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the adversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.21,0:38:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么相信了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what was it that convinced you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.17,0:38:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝指引我找到了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}God led me to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.88,0:38:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的旨意很明确\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his will is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.43,0:38:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.23,0:38:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.73,0:38:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你也看清了事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad to have you onboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.81,0:38:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但先做要紧事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, first things first.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.94,0:38:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得想办法帮我越狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get me the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.57,0:38:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为就像我之前跟你说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because like I told you before…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.99,0:38:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆·温彻斯特必须死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Winchester must die.
